ll - Visiting? 2:1","target":"https://static-v2.boisedev.com/assets/57592d17-0c69-4d28-a6e9-c5d629733da1.png","line":78,"embedded":true}],"metadata":{"title":"‘The right fit’: Ponderosa Center picks new site, ditches lakefront plan","source":"https://valleylookout.com/2026/07/15/the-right-fit-ponderosa-center-picks-new-site-ditches-lakefront-plan/","author":["[[Drew Dodson - Valley Lookout Editor]]"],"published":"2026-07-15","created":"2026-07-20","description":"A performing arts and event venue long planned on the shores of Payette Lake is on the move. Last week, the board of directors for the Ponderosa Center announced that the future venue is no longer slated to be built on land overlooking Payette Lake near Legacy Park. Instead, the nonprofit is leasing two acres off Deinhard […]"},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[]},